BT
/F5 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.157 0.196 0.275 rg
48. 569.8899999999999864 Td
(| Parámetro de Decisión | Flag Booleana \(`isAdmin: boolean`\) | RBAC Formal \(Role-Based Access Control\) | ABAC \(Attribute-Based Access Control\) |) Tj
ET
BT
/F5 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.157 0.196 0.275 rg
48. 557.8899999999999864 Td
(| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |) Tj
